  phaseName: Broken Bridge
  description: 'Before you lies a broken bridge.The air is cold. The wind carries
    the smell of rain and old blood. Your legs tremble. Your vision blurs for a moment.
    You feel the weight of everything you have lost.

    You are here. Alone. On
    this side of the broken bridge.

    What will you do?'
